Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 18:07:54 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] oneplus-instantnoodlep: enable display, GPU and kernel
 flashing on update

- linux-postmarketos-qcom-sm8250: add Samsung AMS678UW01 panel driver,
  enable display and GPU on the OnePlus 8 Pro
- firmware-oneplus-instantnoodlep: install the squashed zap shader to
  qcom/sm8250/OnePlus/instantnoodlep/a650_zap.mbn, use sqe/gmu firmware
  from linux-firmware
- device-oneplus-instantnoodlep: depend on the GPU firmware, set
  deviceinfo_drm and deviceinfo_flash_kernel_on_update

Signed-off-by: Timo <1788603+darknagel@users.noreply.github.com>
